    "detailed_description": "<strong>A fictional DJ who thinks he lives in the real world starts producing a diss track for an internet stalker, but in reality he is its creator <br><br>DJ 8 Beats is a collection of mini arcade games, which can be played individually or in INFINITE 8 mode that mixes the games.<br><br>The game also has Ranking lists showing the 8 best players in each game.<br><br><i>- 8 is Infinite -</i></strong><br><br><br>This game is a love letter to the entertainment industry<br><br>As games nowadays are released unfinished,<br><br>this one is also being released incomplete,<br><br>Count on the day 1 patch for fixes, and the day 8 update patch<br><br>* No expansions will be sold separately<br>** We know this is not an industry practice, but we have to be different in some way, right?<br><br>- Ideal Multimidia",
